# NOTE: do NOT add `*.md export-ignore` here. GitHub's branch zip honours
# export-ignore, and that one line silently stripped EVERY markdown file from
# the archive the installer downloads — so every installed copy shipped with
# zero skills (no SKILL.md) and no system prompt (no prompts/default.md),
# quietly falling back to the built-in prompt. .gitignore already keeps
# internal notes out of the repo, so anything tracked as .md is meant to ship.
docs/ export-ignore
site/downloads/ export-ignore
agent/ export-ignore
router/__pycache__/ export-ignore
*.pyc export-ignore
